  "result": "Titles containing a double quote should now export correctly. The cause was in `src/lib/csv.ts`: `escapeCsvValue` only wrapped a field in quotes when it contained a comma or a line break. A title like `say \"hi\"` was written out raw, and the spreadsheet read the stray quote as the start of a quoted section, which shifted the columns. Commas were fine because they already triggered quoting.\n\nI added `\"` to the `NEEDS_QUOTING` pattern, so those fields are now wrapped in quotes and their embedded quotes are doubled, as RFC 4180 requires. Both export routes use this writer, so the audit-log export is fixed as well.\n\nThe CSV tests pass (8 of 8). I didn't run the rest of the suite.",
